OL,3,CDoorbell footage shows the moment mum
OL,4,Cruns to save children from wildfire
OL,6,FDoorbell footage shows the dramatic
OL,7,Fmoment a young family's home was
OL,8,Fengulfed by flames in Stourbridge.
OL,10,FRichard and Rose-Anne Vinten only
OL,11,Fmoved in five months ago.
OL,13,FTheir home is one of almost 40
OL,14,Fdestroyed or damaged by the wildfire.
OL,16,FA hundred firefighters were tackling
OL,17,Fthe blaze in Stourbridge last night,
OL,18,Fas West Midlands Fire and Rescue
OL,19,FService declared it a major incident.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/4
