OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786745071
OL,3,CDoorbell footage shows the moment mum
OL,4,Cruns to save children from wildfire
OL,6,FAfter taking her two children out of
OL,7,Fthe house, Rose-Anne went back to try
OL,8,Fand dampen the fence to try and stop
OL,9,Fthe spread of fire.
OL,11,FDoorbell footage shows her sprinting
OL,12,Fthrough the garden - less than a
OL,13,Fminute later it was in flames.
OL,15,FRose-Anne said: "It was really scary
OL,16,Fto be honest, it felt like I was in a
OL,17,Fmovie".
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/4
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
