PN,34303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786745071
OL,3,CDoorbell footage shows the moment mum
OL,4,Cruns to save children from wildfire
OL,6,F"I was really scared but I knew at the
OL,7,Fsame time I needed to be brave for my
OL,8,Fkids, because my daughter was really
OL,9,Fworried.
OL,11,F"When I went over to next door and saw
OL,12,Fthem just standing there at the
OL,13,Fwindow, looking and they could see
OL,14,Fthat their house was on fire, so I had
OL,15,Fto just hold it all in.
OL,17,F"I couldn't cry or anything," she said.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/4
