PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786745071
OL,3,CDoorbell footage shows the moment mum
OL,4,Cruns to save children from wildfire
OL,6,FRichard said he'd seen photos of
OL,7,Fhouses nearby on social media, but
OL,8,Funtil they went back to collect his
OL,9,Finsulin they didn't know the extent of
OL,10,Fthe damage.
OL,12,F"It's heartbreaking, we'd only been
OL,13,Fthere for five months. It's our
OL,14,Fforever home and it's gone," said
OL,15,FRichard.
